    "project_purpose": "Arcade.xyz historically operated as an NFT-collateral lending protocol on Ethereum, enabling users to borrow against NFTs through loan origination, vault, and staking-related contracts. Current project messaging describes a broader lending marketplace for memecoins, NFTs, RWAs, and other tokens, with Ethereum and Base advertised; any Base contract surface should be treated as unverified until live deployments are confirmed.",
